  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APPIIC Bridging Contract</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to the Office of Investment Board of Nepal (OIBN) on the following:
1. Capacity support to progress infrastructure projects (of value over USD 60 million) throughput the project cycle through embedded team and experts
2. Institutional Development support to OIBN
3. Institutional Sustainability Support to achieve greater autonomy in finance and human resources

For Enhancing Private Investment, we are working primarily through the Investment Board of Nepal (IBN) and FCDO providing logistical and technical advisory support to the IBN. We have taken on the role of Fund Manager, Technical Skills Pool Manager, and Staff Performance Quality Assurer. We have the lead responsibility for quality assurance oversight of the use of FCDO funds including liaising with IBN&#x2019;s leadership to report on the performance of FCDO-funded IBN staff and of the technical pool of short term experts.</narrative>
  </description>
